- <head>
-
-  <title>CSS Test: absolutely positioned non-replaced element - 'auto' margins, max-width and max-height</title>
-
-  <link rel="author" title="Gérard Talbot" href="http://www.gtalbot.org/BrowserBugsSection/css21testsuite/" />
